entries[22568] = { ["name"] = "Ferocious Bite", ["text"] = "25 Energy Melee Range\nInstant\nRequires Cat Form\nFinishing move that causes damage per combo point [ Glyph of Ferocious Bite : consumes up to 25 additional Energy to increase damage by up to 100%, and heals you for 2% of your total maximum health for each 10 Energy used / and consumes up to 25 additional Energy to increase damage by up to 100%.]\nWhen used on targets below 25% health, Ferocious Bite will also refresh the duration of your Rip on your target.\n\nCritical strike chance increased by 35% against bleeding targets.\n\n1 point : [(((((36 + (Attack Power * 0.196)))) * (( 1 * 1 * 1 ))) + 316 )]-[(((((36 + (Attack Power * 0.196)))) * (( 1 * 1 * 1 ))) + 685 )] damage\n2 points: [(((((36 + (Attack Power * 0.196))) * 2) * (( 1 * 1 * 1 ))) + 316 )]-[(((((36 + (Attack Power * 0.196))) * 2) * (( 1 * 1 * 1 ))) + 685 )] damage\n3 points: [(((((36 + (Attack Power * 0.196))) * 3) * (( 1 * 1 * 1 ))) + 316 )]-[(((((36 + (Attack Power * 0.196))) * 3) * (( 1 * 1 * 1 ))) + 685 )] damage\n4 points: [(((((36 + (Attack Power * 0.196))) * 4) * (( 1 * 1 * 1 ))) + 316 )]-[(((((36 + (Attack Power * 0.196))) * 4) * (( 1 * 1 * 1 ))) + 685 )] damage\n5 points: [(((((36 + (Attack Power * 0.196))) * 5) * (( 1 * 1 * 1 ))) + 316 )]-[(((((36 + (Attack Power * 0.196))) * 5) * (( 1 * 1 * 1 ))) + 685 )] damage" }
entries[22570] = { ["name"] = "Maim", ["text"] = "35 Energy Melee Range\nInstant 10 sec cooldown\nRequires Cat Form\nFinishing move that causes 200% weapon damage and stuns the target. Causes bonus damage and lasts longer per combo point:\n\n1 point : [ 2 * (Mainhand weapon min damage / 2 + 84 + 82 )] to [ 2 * (Mainhand weapon max damage / 2 + 84 + 82 )] damage, 1 sec\n2 points: [ 2 * (Mainhand weapon min damage / 2 + 84 * 2 + 82 )] to [ 2 * (Mainhand weapon max damage / 2 + 84 * 2 + 82 )] damage, 2 sec\n3 points: [ 2 * (Mainhand weapon min damage / 2 + 84 * 3 + 82 )] to [ 2 * (Mainhand weapon max damage / 2 + 84 * 3 + 82 )] damage, 3 sec\n4 points: [ 2 * (Mainhand weapon min damage / 2 + 84 * 4 + 82 )] to [ 2 * (Mainhand weapon max damage / 2 + 84 * 4 + 82 )] damage, 4 sec\n5 points: [ 2 * (Mainhand weapon min damage / 2 + 84 * 5 + 82 )] to [ 2 * (Mainhand weapon max damage / 2 + 84 * 5 + 82 )] damage, 5 sec" }
